      "body": "The bug might be:\n\n```\n  hat/broker/queries.rs:343-354 in register_queryable:\n\n  match res.face_ctxs.get_mut(&ctx.src_face.id) {\n      Some(ctx) => {\n          get_mut_unchecked(ctx).qabl = Some(*info);   // \u2190 OVERWRITES, doesn't merge\n      }\n      None => {\n          let ctx = res.face_ctxs.entry(ctx.src_face.id)\n              .or_insert_with(|| Arc::new(FaceContext::new(ctx.src_face.clone())));\n          get_mut_unchecked(ctx).qabl = Some(*info);\n      }\n  }",
