      "body": "Hey @fuzzypixelz ,\n\nMy use case is that I have two storages (_update: I incorrectly wrote \"two storage plugins\" earlier_) that both subscribe to the same key expression - but one is complete and the other is an incomplete fallback (more specifically, one is a local rocksdb and the other is an eventually consistent S3 replica).  It sounds like what you're saying is that the second storage plugin declaration (complete = false) overrides the first storage plugin declaration (complete = true) and so there isn't a way to use `target` to filter?",
