      "created_at": "2026-06-17T15:40:38Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-17T15:40:38Z",
      "body": "I see two possible solution here:\n1. Update the storage manager plugin to use one session per storage.\n2. Update the session to merge queryable info for multiple queryables on the same keyexpr.\n\nI would lean toward (2) as the least intrusive of the two.",
